Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.74,Hdr,,0,0,0,,November 29, 2020 - Japan Cup
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Kiseki is still well clear in front - up the hill now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:06.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Behind him, the black cap - Almond Eye is closing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:09.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Triple Tiara mare's last race - and Daring Tact on the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,The unbeaten Triple Tiara filly is closing too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:14.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Out wide, the blue cap Contrail - the unbeaten Triple Crown winner
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:17.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Three in front - the Triple Crown winners are about to line up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,200 metres to go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:22.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now from the outside, Almond Eye is about to take over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Contrail outside, Daring Tact through the gap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:29.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Three in front - a miracle clash of Triple Crown winners!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:32.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Not far to go - Almond Eye leads at the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,The winner is Almond Eye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,The clash of the century - the reigning queen wins it in style!